<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova 28-,91-,273-day bills ease, 182-day steady.</title>
<headline>Moldova 28-,91-,273-day bills ease, 182-day steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills fell to 14.50 percent on Tuesday from 18.51 percent on June 24, the National Bank said.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills fell to 18.46 percent from 18.90 percent on June 24.</p>
<p>The yield on 182-day T-bills remained steady from June 24 at 19.11 percent.</p>
<p>The yield on 273-day T-bills fell to 20.51 percent from 20.65 percent on June 10.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				    July 1	     June 24</p>
<p> Issue volume		   2.00 million lei     2.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		  1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 5.6 million	    4.56 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		    2.00 million	   2.00 million</p>
